    "content" : "I got the rest of the goodies in the mail to follow the Dive Into JeeNodes series (<a href=\"http://jeelabs.net/projects/cafe/wiki/Dive_Into_JeeNodes\" class=\"ot-anchor\">http://jeelabs.net/projects/cafe/wiki/Dive_Into_JeeNodes</a>).  I&#39;m very excited to see what I can do with these. Modern Device (<a href=\"http://shop.moderndevice.com/\" class=\"ot-anchor\">http://shop.moderndevice.com/</a>) did an excellent job with the packaging of these boards (they even threw in a free breadboard Leonardo to play around with). I didn&#39;t notice until now that it has a few ports broken out specifically for servos. I definitely have a project in mind that I can use this board for.",
    "objectType" : "note",
